The video call begins.
In Mexico, it is morning now.
There are my father and my mother!
"Good morning, Maya!" calls my father.
"Hello Mom, hello Dad!" I answer.
I am really very happy.
My mother smiles warmly.
"How is the new city?" she asks.
"Are you doing well in Berlin?"
"Yes, everything is wonderful," I say.
"Here is my desk."
"This is my chair."
"And this is my lamp."
My father nods contentedly.
"That is a nice desk," he says.
"Is your flat nice?"
"Yes, my flat is very cozy," I say.
